# Our own temporal upscale on the move (graphics plan 1г, reports/render-features/2026-11-05-upscale/step-1g-1-taau.md):
# the market at noon, the hero walks and the camera follows, as in the first clip of upscale-clips.bench. Stills
# are taken standing (`stand`), as the walk starts (`walk-a`) and in full stride (`walk-b`). The bench is lockstep, so
# the stills of two runs show the same instant and a run at 100 % is the truth for the others:
#   uv run --with numpy --with pillow python -I reports/render-features/2026-11-05-upscale/stills.py walk <100 % dir> <dir> ...
# `ui on` routes each shot through the swapchain-sized frame, so a reduced resolution is upscaled.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui on
view full
cam lift off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
wait 10000
shot stand
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 2500
shot walk-a
wait 1500
shot walk-b
wait 1000
